{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"3837350","name":"Staffer Retro - 异能追忆","type":"game","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《Staffer Retro - 异能追忆》是一款推理冒险游戏，探索与超能力相关的往事吧。</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >法力现象（即异能）是该系列的核心，贯穿故事始终。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >与薇莉塔一同踏上旅程，追寻法力的过往。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家的推理将决定每一章的结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/964a30bd9ea358ddec762f02b71cabf7.avif?t=1788402813\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >跟随流程找到超能力相关的文档，以及留有痕迹的地图。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >整理文档信息，逐步揭开尘封于过往的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/64e7af7e3409e640588d7c816ec529b5.avif?t=1788402813\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【选择行动】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过对话或探索来收集信息与文档，再逐步推理，得出只属于你自己的结论。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >根据你的选择和推理结果，故事将迎来不同的结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/c910c35f377a9a5d2b9f32f9b282be7a.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/c910c35f377a9a5d2b9f32f9b282be7a.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【组合文档进行推理】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作也采用了异能系列特有的系统——基于文档进行推理！在大量记载着超能力相关信息的文档中组合线索，逐步揭开新的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/8b346d9f5b0e30cb260cdf6a475e4520.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/8b346d9f5b0e30cb260cdf6a475e4520.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Re:Story】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从6种不同类型的文档中找出散落的线索。梳理完成后，幕后的真相或许就会浮现。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/83225c66ce4446425ac4d24b8a731f19.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/83225c66ce4446425ac4d24b8a731f19.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Retro系统】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;在平静日常的另一面，隐藏着残酷的真相……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个谜团也是如此，同样存在着“另一面”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >颠覆现有的结论，发现全新的结局。&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/3b6d49fa01a94d81d2741fb0866e8d5a.avif?t=1788402813\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*本游戏的所有内容均可自由直播。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*本游戏的制作过程中完全未使用生成式AI。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/c25c6ce250036bf411ae3a0d1015652ce115d8b6/header_schinese.jpg?t=1788402813","website":"https://www.tetrapod.company/","developers":["Team Tetrapod"],"publishers":["Team Tetrapod","GamePia Co., Ltd."],"release_date":"2026 年 7 月 22 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"24.99","final":"24.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语, 韩语, 日语<strong>*</strong>, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 法语, 德语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":tru